/F1 9.5 Tf
(   \(1\) In General: The amount allowed as a deduction for business interest expense shall) '
/F1 10 Tf
(       not exceed the sum of: \(A\) business interest income, plus \(B\) 30 percent of adjusted) '
/F1 10 Tf
(       taxable income \(ATI\) of the taxpayer.) '
/F1 9.5 Tf
(   \(2\) Adjusted Taxable Income Base: For taxable years beginning after December 31, 2021,) '
/F1 10 Tf
(       ATI is calculated without adding back depreciation, amortization, and depletion \(EBIT standard\).) '
/F1 10 Tf
() '
/F2 11 Tf
(SECTION 250. FOREIGN-DERIVED INTANGIBLE INCOME AND GILTI DEDUCTION) '
/F1 9.5 Tf
(   \(a\) In General: In the case of a domestic corporation, there shall be allowed as a deduction) '
/F1 10 Tf
(       an amount equal to the sum of 37.5 percent of foreign-derived intangible income \(FDII\),) '
/F1 10 Tf
(       and 50.0 percent of global intangible low-taxed income \(GILTI\).) '
/F1 9.5 Tf
(   \(b\) Effective Tax Rates: Results in an effective FDII tax rate of 13.125% and an effective) '
/F1 10 Tf
(       GILTI tax rate of 10.500%.) '
/F2 11 Tf
(SECTION 101. GENERAL ADMINISTRATIVE AND PROCEDURAL PROVISION 101) '
/F1 9.5 Tf
(   \(a\) Scope: Every domestic corporate entity subject to Title 26 shall maintain contemporaneous) '
/F1 10 Tf
(       records substantiating gross income, deductions, and credits for a minimum statutory period) '
/F1 10 Tf
(       of seven \(7\) taxable years from the date the return was filed.) '
/F1 9.5 Tf
(   \(b\) Electronic Transmittal: All filings exceeding $10,000,000 in gross receipts must be) '
/F1 10 Tf
(       transmitted through approved electronic interchange formats pursuant to Treas. Reg. 301.6011.) '
/F1 9.5 Tf
(   \(c\) Penalties for Non-Compliance: Failure to provide complete records within sixty days of formal) '
/F1 10 Tf
(       notice under Section 7602 shall invoke standard computational penalties under Section 6662.) '
/F1 10 Tf
() '
/F2 11 Tf
(SECTION 102. GENERAL ADMINISTRATIVE AND PROCEDURAL PROVISION 102) '
/F1 9.5 Tf
(   \(a\) Scope: Every domestic corporate entity subject to Title 26 shall maintain contemporaneous) '
/F1 10 Tf
(       records substantiating gross income, deductions, and credits for a minimum statutory period) '
/F1 10 Tf
(       of seven \(7\) taxable years from the date the return was filed.) '
/F1 9.5 Tf
(   \(b\) Electronic Transmittal: All filings exceeding $10,000,000 in gross receipts must be) '
